MODULE: coding.helper.enforce_quota
VERSION: 1.0.0
DESCRIPTION: Enforces per-job byte quota limits and logs warnings on excess usage.
DEPENDS: coding.config, logging
EXPORT: enforce_quota

FUNCTION enforce_quota(
    $job_id,
    $usage_bytes,
    [ $config_path ]
) {
    # Load per-job quota from config, defaulting to 4096 bytes
    my $quota = $config_path
        ? coding.config.read($config_path, "quota", 4096)
        : 4096;

    # Check if usage exceeds quota
    if ($usage_bytes > $quota) {
        logging.warning("Job {$job_id} exceeded quota: used {$usage_bytes}B, limit {$quota}B");
        return FALSE;
    }

    return TRUE;
}
```

**Time complexity:** O(1) — single config lookup and comparison.  
**Space complexity:** O(1) — no additional data structures allocated.
